OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found in caravan was
OL,4,Astrangled, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 62-year-old woman who died last month
OL,7,Fwas strangled, an inquest heard.
OL,9,FSusan Lumsden was found by police
OL,10,Finside a caravan at Overstone Lakes in
OL,11,FSywell, Northamptonshire, on 24 August
OL,12,Fafter responding to calls about an
OL,13,Fassault.
OL,15,FSenior coroner Anne Pember said the
OL,16,Fprovisional cause of death was
OL,17,F"compression of the neck pending
OL,18,Ftoxicology". The inquest has been
OL,19,Fadjourned until 10 March next year.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
