OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found in caravan was
OL,4,Astrangled, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Lewis, 72, of Cherrytree Walk,
OL,7,Fwho lived in the same caravan park,
OL,8,Fappeared at Northampton Crown Court
OL,9,Fearlier this month and was remanded
OL,10,Finto custody after being charged with
OL,11,Fher murder.
